OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance trust improves amid     
OL,4,Aincreased pressures                    
OL,6,FAn ambulance trust has made significant
OL,7,Fimprovements in staffing and           
OL,8,Fperformance, according to the health   
OL,9,Fregulator.                             
OL,11,FThe East of England Ambulance Service  
OL,12,F(EEAST) has seen its rating for urgent 
OL,13,Fand emergency care upgraded from       
OL,14,F"inadequate" to "good" by the Care     
OL,15,FQuality Commission (CQC).              
OL,17,FLast year the service was issued with a
OL,18,Fwarning notice by the regulator over   
OL,19,Fits staffing levels and call wait      
OL,20,Ftimes.                                 
