OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance trust improves amid     
OL,4,Aincreased pressures                    
OL,6,FNeill Moloney, the trust's chief       
OL,7,Fexecutive, paid tribute to the staff's 
OL,8,F"professionalism, commitment and       
OL,9,Fdetermination to deliver high-quality  
OL,10,Fcare".                                 
